contentMarkdown:
This leather is approximately 1.6mm thick and is oiled, giving it a dark, vintage look that will lighten with time or physical stresses: knocks, twists, bends.

Time will only make this leather much more typical and pretty, the stamp will do many favours to the aesthetics of your products 😎

## Cleaning

For maintenance, use a standard, non-coloured shoe care product. If in doubt, test the product on a small, inconspicuous part of the leather.

